    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/261d1d42599cb4a82d02a5445ad09709.avif?t=1739481003\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker puts you in control of a seasoned antiquity scavenger, a man whose main objective is finding rare objects in the ruins of civilization. When you uncover an artifact capable of not only informing the past but also shaping the future, everything changes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make major decisions about how you interact with the world around you, enter into erotic relationships, and live with the consequences of either dominating or saving both the people and landscape of post-apocalyptic Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.poster.avif?t=1739481003\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.webm?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.mp4?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/cddbd08e3de7af29ea7ac573e71877ae.webp?t=1739481003\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker offers a Adult Visual Novel experience featuring a richly developed story that is full of characters to care about and stakes to invest in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the tale being told while also helping shape it through high-impact decisions and narrative choices that will determine how people perceive you and how you mold the world at large. Choose to win people over the old-fashioned way or simply take what you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your story, your pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features traditional linear storytelling sequences as well as free-roam elements that give players control over which quests to pursue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a gritty dystopian adventure or a harem simulator that focuses on the women of the Desert Stalker universe, the game will conform to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker is filled with cinematic sequences, music, and sound effects designed for added immersion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.poster.avif?t=1739481003\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.webm?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.mp4?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/8cd155c8c79b19692baff0b768d1165b.webp?t=1739481003\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Personalize your playthrough</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional content filters give you the tools to tailor your Desert Stalker experience as you see fit. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave your mark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how you behave in an AVN that gives you unique opportunities to dominate the world around you and experience the ultimate gritty, dystopian fantasy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax with your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the wasteland? You can unwind in your living room and enjoy the company of your household's members and servants. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig into the lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an in-game library that contains lore about the Desert Stalker universe, giving you an enhanced look at the world around you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revisit the highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the integrated scene gallery, which will keep you coming back to watch your favorite scenes over, and over, and over.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/1671507aa033d691de5796c9bd776427.avif?t=1739481003\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/261d1d42599cb4a82d02a5445ad09709.avif?t=1739481003\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker puts you in control of a seasoned antiquity scavenger, a man whose main objective is finding rare objects in the ruins of civilization. When you uncover an artifact capable of not only informing the past but also shaping the future, everything changes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make major decisions about how you interact with the world around you, enter into erotic relationships, and live with the consequences of either dominating or saving both the people and landscape of post-apocalyptic Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.poster.avif?t=1739481003\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.webm?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/a63d6c445db5b145af717007938398b2.mp4?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/cddbd08e3de7af29ea7ac573e71877ae.webp?t=1739481003\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker offers a Adult Visual Novel experience featuring a richly developed story that is full of characters to care about and stakes to invest in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the tale being told while also helping shape it through high-impact decisions and narrative choices that will determine how people perceive you and how you mold the world at large. Choose to win people over the old-fashioned way or simply take what you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your story, your pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features traditional linear storytelling sequences as well as free-roam elements that give players control over which quests to pursue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a gritty dystopian adventure or a harem simulator that focuses on the women of the Desert Stalker universe, the game will conform to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Stalker is filled with cinematic sequences, music, and sound effects designed for added immersion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.poster.avif?t=1739481003\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.webm?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/0afa065488fbbc59990d8ebc8ba40c35.mp4?t=1739481003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/8cd155c8c79b19692baff0b768d1165b.webp?t=1739481003\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Personalize your playthrough</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional content filters give you the tools to tailor your Desert Stalker experience as you see fit. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave your mark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how you behave in an AVN that gives you unique opportunities to dominate the world around you and experience the ultimate gritty, dystopian fantasy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax with your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the wasteland? You can unwind in your living room and enjoy the company of your household's members and servants. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig into the lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an in-game library that contains lore about the Desert Stalker universe, giving you an enhanced look at the world around you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revisit the highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the integrated scene gallery, which will keep you coming back to watch your favorite scenes over, and over, and over.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899050/extras/1671507aa033d691de5796c9bd776427.avif?t=1739481003\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p>",
